Database schema changes are managed by Alembic.

From the backend directory:

    alembic upgrade head
    alembic current
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe schema change"

For a database whose tables were previously created by Base.metadata.create_all(),
first verify that its schema matches revision 20260803_0001, make a backup, and run:

    alembic stamp 20260803_0001

Do not run stamp on an empty database. Empty databases must use alembic upgrade head.
